Subject: Cantor Identity Accounting Store Bootstrap P3 Formation Solution

@ [solution_uuid] 15814f60-d326-4e76-b270-c0101764c0de

& [Solution]
  + place a reusable bootstrap function and separate one-shot CLI in cantor_identity_accounting_mcp
  + validate the supplied ledger as exact canonical machine form before creating any target path
  + create one absent directory persist and reload one P1 genesis with P2 primitives and only then emit one typed receipt

& [Boundary] is bootstrap converts an already admitted ledger into restart custody; it does not decide which objects deserve admission
